# Dated accept-risk file for the release-train image scan (trivy --ignorefile).
# Each entry: the CVE, an expiry, and a comment naming the pinning package and
# the image it ships in. The release owner reads every entry at the accept-risk
# gate of the release it rides in. Trivy re-flags an entry the day its exp: passes; expiry
# is the forcing function to revisit the pin, not a renewal reminder.
# Single writer: studio-dev. Reaches the scanner (studio) via the release rsync.

# chatterbox-tts 0.1.7 pins diffusers 0.29.0; ships in studio-worker-audio.
